{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act13d5_level_act13d5_01_end",
  "groupId": "act13d5",
  "stageId": "act13d5_01",
  "title": "艾倫精選",
  "storyCode": "MN-1",
  "avgTag": "行動後",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act13d5/level_act13d5_01_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "d9b7f8b7a223d4ebb158869857a8aaf08dc5321dba45d85c2c721fe6763e66f0",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "卡西米尔 1下"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "text": "（裝備，穿戴完畢。劍......是姐姐以前的訓練劍，應該還能用吧？）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "text": "（就這樣出發......）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "text": "啊......瑪恩納叔叔.....",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪恩納",
      "text": "怎麼，還嫌臨光家不夠丟人嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "text": "不是的——！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪恩納",
      "text": "騎士競技......部門的同事已經告訴我這件事了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪恩納",
      "text": "你不配站上騎士競技的賽場，而騎士競技也配不上臨光之名。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪恩納",
      "text": "是佐菲婭慫恿的嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "text": "不是的！是我自願——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪恩納",
      "text": "我想也是。佐菲婭雖然只是臨光家的陪侍，但好歹也在那種商業鬧劇裡佔有一席之地......她現在也是“騎士階級”了，呵。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪恩納",
      "text": "可，你呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "text": "我......我只是想保護......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪恩納",
      "text": "就算被剝奪了貴族身份，我們的信條也不會有一絲動搖，沒有什麼需要被保護。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "text": "就算這麼說......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪恩納",
      "text": "更沒有什麼需要你保護，瑪莉婭。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪恩納",
      "text": "別和瑪嘉烈一樣，只因為年輕氣盛就輕易打破了那份矜持——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪恩納",
      "text": "——部長？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪恩納",
      "text": "晚上好，嗯，是的，是我沒錯......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪恩納",
      "text": "請閣下務必放心，如果您對先前的會議有任何疑問都可以來找我......什麼？不，不，請您再考慮一下......求您了，是的......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "瑪恩納瞥了一眼瑪莉婭，他冷漠地走上樓去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪恩納",
      "text": "不，的確是我的工作失誤，與閣下無關，稍後我會將修訂過的文檔郵寄給您......明天，對，明天一定......非常抱歉。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪恩納",
      "text": "不，懇求您務必再考慮一下。嗯，一定，是的，我不會再犯這種失誤，請原諒......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪恩納",
      "text": "——瑪莉婭，下次再說回你的事情，希望你自己有點分寸。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "text": "叔叔......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "text": "不......現在動搖有什麼用，快要趕不上和佐菲婭約定的時間了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "text": "唔——！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "text": "站穩了，注意節奏。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "text": "呼——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "text": "十分鐘，一次反擊都沒有。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "text": "呃......說是單手對付我，你的那把劍不就是單手用的嗎！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "text": "全力以赴的話另一隻手也不會閒著的，想試試萊塔尼亞人的作戰方法嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "text": "我是聽說過各國的騎士有著迥異的風格......但佐菲婭姐姐連那種都可以做到的！？欺負人吧！？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "text": "照葫蘆畫瓢罷了，我也不是什麼都沒準備就打輸了那場比賽的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "text": "姑母......？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "text": "欸，已經過去那麼長時間了，我也不是特別在意了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "text": "倒是你啊......現在你這個水準，上了賽場真的只是炮灰而已喔。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "text": "嗚......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "text": "好了，繼續。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "text": "好、好的，但是能再等半分鐘嗎，我的腿在發抖——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "text": "如果這都堅持不下來的話，那勸你放棄。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "text": "唔——！好，來吧！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "一天後"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "text": "哈......哈......怎、怎麼樣？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "text": "什麼怎麼樣......你站都站不住了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "text": "除了睡覺和吃飯......基本......一直在運動啊，佐菲婭姐姐......你就一點也不累嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "text": "......你知道團體混戰賽嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "text": "騎士競技中最有看點的賽制，每個騎士團派出一名代表，不過你的情況屬於獨立參賽。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "text": "然後在十人到數十人不等的巨大人造賽場上，以命中盔甲的次數判定分數，最後轉換成競賽積分。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "text": "當然了......如果在時限結束前被擊倒或是失去作戰能力則是直接出局，分數歸零。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "text": "......這、這我還是知道的啦......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "text": "嗯哼。那你知道一場混戰賽的時長會有多久嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "text": "......幾個小時？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "text": "歷史上最長的一次團體混戰，狂熱的觀眾和企業一次次加時下，持續了一天一夜。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "text": "騎士們就像是被趕進籠子的鉗獸，被迫一次次重整旗鼓，互相戰鬥。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "text": "呃......？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "text": "一天一夜，出局的人全都一無所獲，負傷慘重，但留到最後的三個人一舉得到了正賽的入場資格，足夠多的積分。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "text": "這、這樣......欸，一整天的戰鬥只有三個人能順利晉級嗎......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "text": "自從第一個賽區贊助商推出這種模式之後，效仿的商家就比源石蟲還快地冒了出來。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "text": "怎麼說呢......雖然吃相難看，但可悲的是，觀眾喜歡，那也就無論結果如何了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "text": "所以你起碼做好打上一天一夜也不會累的準備！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "text": "——一天一夜！？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "一周後"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "text": "呼......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "text": "今天就到這裡結束吧，有點進步。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "text": "啊——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "text": "運動結束之後不要立刻躺下，起來走兩步，想想晚上吃什麼。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "text": "好、好吧，唔！腿好酸......！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "text": "當然了，你的步調實在太不像樣了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "text": "競速賽......就不指望了，只要那些出名的騎士團裡還有那麼幾個專精競速賽的選手，我們就沒什麼希望。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "text": "但就算這樣，在人造地形中的機動性也是很重要的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "text": "當然......因為競速賽本質也是依賴裝備的賽制，除了體能之外，我們也沒有那麼多資金折騰......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "text": "......你在聽嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "text": "啊——！我想到了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "text": "唔？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "text": "上次修點唱機的時候，馬丁叔叔送了兩張餐廳優惠券給我，我們去那裡吃晚餐吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "text": "你啊......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "text": "欸，別急著生氣呀，我只是想犒勞一下佐菲婭......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "text": "我沒生氣，那我們什麼時候出發？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "text": "既然難得一起出去吃飯......起碼換身衣服洗個澡？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "text": "好吧......不過吃完飯回來還是要繼續的，別太鬆懈了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "text": "嗯！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "text": "（瑪莉婭的進步很明顯。我還以為她只不過是一時衝動.....）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "text": "（她真的是認真的......比她表現出來的還要認真。畢竟我都覺得這種訓練強度過而不及......本來想著讓她放棄來著。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "text": "（拼命到這個地步還保持著平時那副樂天派的態度......也不知道和誰學的。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "text": "（這算是鬥志嗎......）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "佐菲婭抬起頭，雜草叢生的花園極遠處，高樓廣廈，燈火輝煌。\n像是要欺騙自己一樣，她悄悄用從未使用過的那隻手撫上劍柄。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "在劍刃出鞘之前，肌肉的劇痛從腰部傳遞到手臂，意料之中，在失去知覺前，她放下了手。\n三周後"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老工匠",
      "text": "這兩個丫頭多久沒出現了？明明可以在休息時間去酒吧坐坐的，這麼見外幹嘛。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老工匠",
      "text": "還是說，“閉門修煉”在今天的年輕人之間也很流行？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老騎士",
      "text": "......哪個年代流行過？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老工匠",
      "text": "我年輕的時候。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老騎士",
      "text": "騎士不都是雲遊四方鍛煉自己的，哪有閉門修行過？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老工匠",
      "text": "......嘁，雇得起天災信使又有移動手段的騎士老爺們哪懂人間疾苦......為了給你搞把好劍差點沒累死在工坊裡......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老騎士",
      "text": "嘟囔什麼呢，要罵就罵，別陰陽怪氣的，吵架我怕過你嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老工匠",
      "text": "你還真當自己還是那個騎士老爺了！？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老騎士",
      "text": "噓！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老騎士",
      "text": "......聽見了沒......是丫頭們練劍的聲音。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老工匠",
      "text": "我沒聾！嗯，不錯，市面上的訓練劍都太輕了，那些垃圾廠商還喜歡偷工減料。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老工匠",
      "text": "但這兩把的聲音很悅耳，啊，應該說相當不錯......可我怎麼好像聽過這把劍的聲音？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老騎士",
      "text": "因為你老了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老工匠",
      "text": "我懶得和你鬥，趕緊的！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老工匠",
      "text": "......你不是迷路了吧？老糊塗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老騎士",
      "text": "急什麼！？佐菲婭的花園這麼大——我們應該問門口的僕人要台摩托車的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老工匠",
      "text": "摩托車有啥用，佐菲婭家的雜草比臨湖河畔的森林還他娘的茂盛，你往哪兒開？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老騎士",
      "text": "喂，小心腳下。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老工匠",
      "text": "唔哦——差點絆著我......這是啥？引擎蓋？在花園裡的引擎蓋？？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "text": "注意腳步！調整呼吸！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "text": "是、是！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老工匠",
      "text": "嚯......基本功。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老工匠",
      "text": "這都一個月了還在扎實基本功，看來要錯過不少積分了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老騎士",
      "text": "......科瓦爾，你是不是真的老糊塗了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老工匠",
      "text": "啊！？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老騎士",
      "text": "練了一個月基本功是沒錯，但瑪莉婭怎麼也是臨光家的小女兒......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老騎士",
      "text": "你覺得老天馬和瑪嘉烈還在的時候，她沒有練過這些“基本功”嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老工匠",
      "text": "啊......是哦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老騎士",
      "text": "什麼擅長領域，什麼身價排名，吃飽了撐的才折騰那些玩意——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老騎士",
      "text": "——真正的卡西米爾騎士就該這樣，精進武藝！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "text": "呼啊......呼啊......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "text": "不要停下來，勢頭不錯，繼續！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "text": "但是......真的......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "text": "是嘛是嘛，那就做好在床上躺三天的準備吧——！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "text": "——！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老騎士",
      "text": "（口哨）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老工匠",
      "text": "嚯，這一劍還是有點意思的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "光頭馬丁",
      "text": "反手劍，非常快，而且直取要害。這是特訓的成果嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老工匠",
      "text": "......你什麼時候來的？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "光頭馬丁",
      "text": "剛剛。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "光頭馬丁",
      "text": "呵呵，不過眼前這光景，倒是讓我想起瑪嘉烈還在的時候啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "text": "你剛才......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "text": "欸？啊？好像習慣性的就......我怎麼了嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "text": "啊......你的劍呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "text": "被、被你打飛了......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "text": "欸！？我！?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "text": "少得意！只是我一時不忍心被你鑽了空隙！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "text": "啊。原來佐菲婭還是會有不忍心的時候啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "text": "嘖......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "text": "那......？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "text": "......行啦，我答應你，好吧，參加騎士競技。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "text": "真的？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "text": "但是我要作為教練全程陪同，你對騎士競技基本就是一知半解......賽程安排，積分獲取，情報分析，我們還有很多——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "text": "——別躺下！起來！我們還要好多事情要準備。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "text": "欸、欸.......就稍微，休息一會......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "text": "別睡啊......！？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
